    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, build, and survive on an island full of secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy sandbox, you\u2019ll arrive on a mysterious island, alone or with up to 3 friends. Face growing challenges, cultivate your own resources, and uncover ancient secrets hidden among ruins, forests, and mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Building and survival:</strong> Construct your shelter, farm with a water-dependent system, upgrade your weapons by combining unique gems, and prepare everything you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Exploration:</strong> Roam a landscape full of secrets, alternative paths, and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Co-op mode:</strong> Play online with up to 3 friends. Divide tasks, share resources, and face the island\u2019s dangers together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Retro style:</strong> Graphics inspired by the classic Mode 7 effect, blending simulated 3D depth with 2D pixel art elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of resources, combinations, and possible paths. Whether you build a peaceful home or challenge the island\u2019s darkest secrets, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cFrom the depths of the ocean, a mysterious island emerges only on rare occasions, revealing forgotten secrets and hidden riches. As a member of the legendary Guild of Mysterious Island Explorers, you and your team venture into the unknown, determined to uncover its enigmas. But you are not alone: relentless enemies and dark forces lurk in every shadow, ready to thwart your progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The success of this expedition will depend on your cunning, bravery\u2026 and teamwork.\u201d</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, build, and survive on an island full of secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy sandbox, you\u2019ll arrive on a mysterious island, alone or with up to 3 friends. Face growing challenges, cultivate your own resources, and uncover ancient secrets hidden among ruins, forests, and mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Building and survival:</strong> Construct your shelter, farm with a water-dependent system, upgrade your weapons by combining unique gems, and prepare everything you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Exploration:</strong> Roam a landscape full of secrets, alternative paths, and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Co-op mode:</strong> Play online with up to 3 friends. Divide tasks, share resources, and face the island\u2019s dangers together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 <strong>Retro style:</strong> Graphics inspired by the classic Mode 7 effect, blending simulated 3D depth with 2D pixel art elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of resources, combinations, and possible paths. Whether you build a peaceful home or challenge the island\u2019s darkest secrets, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cFrom the depths of the ocean, a mysterious island emerges only on rare occasions, revealing forgotten secrets and hidden riches. As a member of the legendary Guild of Mysterious Island Explorers, you and your team venture into the unknown, determined to uncover its enigmas. But you are not alone: relentless enemies and dark forces lurk in every shadow, ready to thwart your progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The success of this expedition will depend on your cunning, bravery\u2026 and teamwork.\u201d</strong></p>",
